    {"title": "Fronius Datamanager Modbus TCP & RTU", "version": "42,0410,2049 033-24022026", "date": "2026-02", "url": "https://www.fronius.com/~/downloads/Solar%20Energy/Operating%20Instructions/42,0410,2049.pdf", "note": "addressing, device IDs, data types, unavailable values"},
    {"title": "Modbus SunSpec Maps, State Codes and Events (register map spreadsheets)", "version": "archive 1.1.7", "date": "2024-04", "url": "https://www.fronius.com/~/downloads/Solar%20Energy/Operating%20Instructions/SE_EI_Modbus_Sunspec_Maps_State_Codes_Events_EN.zip", "note": "float meter models 211-213"}
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Fronius inverters with the Datamanager 2.0, read through SunSpec models (float meter models 211-213).",
    "Addresses are the register numbers printed in the manual (1-based): the first register, 40001, is sent on the wire as 40000.",
    "Register positions after the inverter model change with the SunSpec model type (float or integer with scale factors), selected in the Datamanager web interface or in register 216.",
    "A value the device cannot provide is returned as the unavailable value of its type (see sentinels).",
    "A Fronius Smart Meter on the Datamanager is read with Modbus device ID 240 (240 to 244 for several meters)."
  ],
